What this is:                                                      Source made PROM 8 5/20/87                                         32k KKIA serial                                                 Target can reproduce itself over serial umbilical.              Interrupts ready to test.                                                                                                    600 has exact text of PROM 8.                                                                                                   On initial power up, UART sends framing error followed by          TWO initial TYPE requests because we let the watchdog go.    On normal reset, we simply get a TYPE request.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               