    Sucks up contents of the nTH PROM.           Instructions for burner setup:                                     1.  Connect serial cable to BURNER task's port (9600).          2.  Apply power.                                                3.  Select device type.                                         4.  Burn & check each PROM.                                  Install & remove devices after PROM type selected & idle.       ( Benchmarks)   EMPTY   DECIMAL                                 : ONE   COUNTER  10 0 DO  10000 0 DO  LOOP  LOOP  TIMER ;       : TWO   COUNTER  10000 0 DO  I I I */ DROP  LOOP  TIMER ;       : SIX   COUNTER >R  1068 LOAD  R> TIMER ;                       : SEV   COUNTER  10000 0 DO  I I * DROP  LOOP  TIMER ;          : ATE   COUNTER  10000 0 DO  1000 I / DROP  LOOP  TIMER ;       : NIN   COUNTER  10000 0 DO  1000 I /MOD 2DROP  LOOP  TIMER ;   : THIR  COUNTER  10000 0 DO  PAUSE LOOP  TIMER ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ( Back door crib sheet)   EMPTY                                 : REAR ( n - n)   31421 * 6927 + 10000 /MOD DROP ;                                                                              : MOD   /MOD DROP ;                                             : CRIB   PAGE CR CR CR  10 0 DO  CR I 10 * 5 U.R  10 0 DO             J 16 * I + REAR  I 5 MOD 0= 2* 5 + U.R  LOOP LOOP SPACE ;                                                                                                                                                                